{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-p007a","title":"孙亮查明黄门投鼠矢陷害藏吏并处罚黄门","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-a8a7e112bf9ed1479866","label":"裴注·江表传","text":"孙亮查明黄门投鼠矢陷害藏吏并处罚黄门","evidence":["santizhu-q-5d02519775e1ec9a1249"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0128","role":"调查并处罚黄门","evidence":["santizhu-q-5d02519775e1ec9a1249"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-5d02519775e1ec9a1249"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-5d02519775e1ec9a1249","source_order":[48,7,8],"order":8530}],"persons":[{"id":"wuzhu-p0128","name":"孙亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-5d02519775e1ec9a1249","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-03da4327d42f3fd1b2e5","layer":"pei","quote":"亮使黄门以银碗并盖，就中藏吏取交州所献甘蔗饧。黄门先恨藏吏，以鼠矢投饧中；启言藏吏不谨。亮呼吏持饧器入，问曰：‘此器既盖之，且有掩覆，无缘有此；黄门将有恨于汝邪？’吏叩头曰：‘尝从某求宫中莞席；宫席有数，不敢与。’亮曰：‘必是此也！’覆问黄门，具首伏。即于目前加髡鞭，斥付外署。","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":117,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7f51ee789134c097e810","start":8,"end":147}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
